      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "Как-то так:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">SELECT t.topic_id, p.post_id, p.post_html\nFROM bb_topics t, bb_posts_html p\nLEFT JOIN bb_bt_torrents tor ON (tor.post_id = p.post_id)\nWHERE t.topic_first_post_id = p.post_id\nAND tor.topic_id IS NOT NULL\nLIMIT 0, 10</pre>",
